+	  optimized versions.  If unsure, say N.
+
+config RAID6_PQ_BENCHMARK
+	bool "Automatically choose fastest RAID6 PQ functions"
+	depends on RAID6_PQ
+	default y
+	help
+	  Benchmark all available RAID6 PQ functions on init and choose the
+	  fastest one.
